Fetch content from a named platform through the agent-reach CLI: Twitter/X, Reddit, Facebook, Instagram, YouTube, GitHub, Bilibili, XiaoHongShu, Xiaoyuzhou podcasts, LinkedIn, Boss直聘, V2EX, Xueqiu stocks, or an RSS feed. Use only when the user names one of these platforms or shares a URL on one of them. NOT for general web research, "look this up", or "research X" (the research skill owns those), not for writing reports or analysis, and not for write operations such as posting, commenting, or liking.
